                <airSeal>By air sealing and adding an HRV you could also be eligible for a $5000 Yukon Good Energy Rebate.</airSeal>
                <mainWalls>By upgrading your wall insulation you could be eligible for up to $12,000 from the Yukon Good Energy Rebates. For more information see below:

Good Energy Program website: 
https://yukon.ca/good-energy
</mainWalls>
                <exposedFloors>To receive the insulation rebate for slabs or floor systems:

   the insulation level must be R20 or less prior to the renovation; and
   you must increase it by at least R20.
</exposedFloors>
                <foundation>By upgrading your wall insulation you could be eligible for up to $12,000 from the Yukon Good Energy Rebates. For more information see below:</foundation>
                <HeatingSystem>Currently the only rebates for heating systems are by adding an air source heat pump. </HeatingSystem>
            </RURComments>
